From c38bd8b3d19dacd52c5ed2ff4a18172fd0a30e1c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Carmen Bianca Bakker <carmen@coopiteasy.be>
Date: Fri, 1 Apr 2022 16:31:02 +0200
Subject: [FIX] easy_my_coop: Fix name computation

Previously, if either firstname or lastname was (unexpectedly) empty, an
error would be thrown.

This commit uses approximately the same code approach as
partner-contact/partner_firstname to compute the full name.

Signed-off-by: Carmen Bianca Bakker <carmen@coopiteasy.be>
---
